<p>I had this idea ages ago. I've been trying to write it for ten years or so, and finally got it to gel right. It was originally born as a lovecraft-ish "diary after the event" style of story, but it's changed, I hope for the better.</p>
<p>Please…rip in to this. If you like it, excellent, PLEASE say so, but also let me know about issues with pacing, word choice, spelling, whatever. This is sort of my "flagship" story. Once I get this fixed well, I'm hoping to make many more.</p>

