<p>Wow. I'm impressed.</p>
<p>This started off a little slow. Well, a lot slow. the first few paragraphs felt kind of unnecissary, honestly. It works just fine starting with the "who is paul" bit, I think.</p>
<p>Once it picks up pace, though, it's relentless. Starting about halfway through, when paul first reappears at the office, this story starts to pull the reader along, absolutely compelling them to keep reading. And boy, is it worth it. That last line freaked me out more than anything else in the story.</p>

