			<div class="content" id="post-content-801242">
									

<p>Damn, big post is big…</p>
<p>Thank you, I'll be doing some digging and see what i can tweak. I admit, some of the awkwardness is intentional. I know it makes for annoying reading, but when I write these kind of first-person stories, I try to do so at least somewhat like the protagonist. While we, in our literary trappings, may be able to carve and sculpt carefully, the people in my stories often lack the knowledge or time to do so.</p>
<p>that's not to say I don't screw up. I do. A lot. I appreciate all the feedback, big time, and I'm taking everything under advisement, trust me. The fact that, warts and all, you got some shivers, gives me a great deal of hope.</p>

